- Simpler, no new abstraction
- Faster to implement
- Easier to understand in isolation

## Cons
- Code duplication (~90 lines duplicated)
- Two copies of sampleTrackAtTime
- Harder to maintain if pattern needs changes

## Trade-off Decision
Use this if:
- Only 2 animations will ever use this pattern
- Team prefers explicit over abstract
- Time pressure requires fastest solution

